              How Is a Countdown Different From a Timeline or Calendar?
            </h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            They answer different questions. Use the countdown for how long, the timeline for what and when, and the calendar for exactly which day.
          </p>

