          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            Both work, and they do different jobs. A digital wedding countdown clock updates itself, is easy to share and goes wherever your phone goes. A paper wedding countdown calendar on the fridge is harder to ignore and easy for a whole household to see.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            If you like crossing things off with a pen, print a checklist and keep the digital countdown as your source of truth. Our <a href="/checklists/printable-wedding-planning-checklist" class="text-[#B76E79] font-bold underline hover:text-[#a25d66]">printable wedding planning checklist</a> is a good place to start.
